OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions
OL,4,
OL,5,FLabour's Jackie Baillie's raises the
OL,6,Ftraumatic cases of women who have had
OL,7,Fmiscarriages, saying the SNP
OL,8,Fgovernment's approach to the maternity
OL,9,Fand gynaecology health is failing
OL,11,FJohn Swinney says he is very sorry
OL,12,Fabout the experiences the women have
OL,13,Fhad, but his government has "commenced
OL,14,Fa whole series of inspections [of
OL,15,Fmaternity units] around the country"
OL,17,FReform's Malcolm Offord says the
OL,18,Frecently published Pisa statistics on
OL,19,Feducation are "disastrous for young
OL,20,Fpeople and embarrassing for the nation"
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
