OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions
OL,4,
OL,5,FSwinney says that the international
OL,6,Fsurvey, which saw Scotland falling in
OL,7,Freading and maths. is just one measure
OL,8,Fand there are plenty of other metrics
OL,9,Fshowing Scottish education is working
OL,11,FToday's FMQs session comes after the FM
OL,12,Fwrote to Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,13,Finviting him to meet and consider the
OL,14,Fconstitutional future of Scotland
OL,16,FYou can follow events in the Holyrood
OL,17,Fchamber by clicking on the Watch live
OL,18,Ficon at the top of this page from just
OL,19,Fbefore 14:00
